<!-- COMPONENT BREAKDOWN -->
<h2>5. Detailed Component Specifications</h2>

<h3>5.1 Navbar Component (<code>Navbar.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Sticky Transition:</strong> Automatically toggles translucent background styling when scroll depth exceeds 60px.</li>
    <li><strong>Visitor Counter:</strong> Reads persistent visitor count from <code>localStorage</code> / <code>sessionStorage</code> and renders with a pulsing <code>Radio</code> icon.</li>
    <li><strong>Mobile Drawer:</strong> Accessible mobile drawer with animated hamburger toggle and automatic menu closing upon navigation.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.2 Hero Component (<code>Hero.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Brand Metrics:</strong> Showcases 37+ Years of Excellence, 500+ Timepieces, 12,000+ Verified Customers, and 3 Flagship Boutiques.</li>
    <li><strong>Conversion Actions:</strong> Direct navigation buttons to explore product collections or schedule an in-person concierge consultation.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.3 Products & Modal Component (<code>Products.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Category Filtering:</strong> Tabs for Luxury, Vintage, Smart, and Classic watch categories.</li>
    <li><strong>Product Detail Modal:</strong> In-depth dialog overlay detailing case diameter, crystal type, movement caliber, water resistance, stock availability, and direct booking actions.</li>
    <li><strong>Vector Badges:</strong> Uses Lucide <code>Tag</code>, <code>Gem</code>, <code>CheckCircle</code>, and <code>ChevronRight</code> icons.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.4 Technology Showcase (<code>Technology.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Engineering Spotlights:</strong> Features Swiss Mechanical COSC certification, Eco-Drive solar light harvesting, Mohs-9 sapphire crystal, multi-band GPS, 300m dive resistance, and Bulova 262 kHz Precisionist quartz.</li>
    <li><strong>Accreditation Badges:</strong> Displays ISO 6425 dive ratings, MIL-STD-810G military standards, and Côtes de Genève finishing standards.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.5 Complete Price List (<code>PriceList.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Data Grid:</strong> Comprehensive sorted table of all models, brands, movements, and water ratings.</li>
    <li><strong>Stock Indicators:</strong> Real-time status pills using <code>CheckCircle2</code> for In Stock and <code>XCircle</code> for Out of Stock.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.6 Visual Gallery & Lightbox (<code>Gallery.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Hover Zoom:</strong> Micro-interaction revealing title overlay and Lucide <code>ZoomIn</code> icon.</li>
    <li><strong>Lightbox Dialog:</strong> Modal overlay with keyboard event listeners, backdrop dismissal, and high-resolution imagery.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.7 Store Locator (<code>StoreLocator.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Boutique Selector:</strong> Switch between New York Flagship (Fifth Ave), Beverly Hills (Wilshire Blvd), and Chicago (Magnificent Mile).</li>
    <li><strong>Direct Maps Integration:</strong> Direct encoded Google Maps URL redirection for driving directions.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.8 Support & FAQ Accordion (<code>Support.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Service Guarantees:</strong> Expert Repair, 3-Year In-House Warranty, Free Insured Shipping ($500+), and 30-Day Hassle-Free Returns.</li>
    <li><strong>Interactive Accordion:</strong> Animated disclosure widgets for appraisal questions, turnaround times, and financing options.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.9 About Us (<code>About.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Founder Legacy:</strong> Story of master watchmaker Alberto Reyes and 37 years of horological craftsmanship.</li>
    <li><strong>Credential Grid:</strong> Icons for Geneva/Tokyo certified watchmakers, GIA-certified appraisers, AWCI affiliation, and 4.9/5 star customer reviews.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.10 Contact & Social Links (<code>Contact.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Info Cards:</strong> Headquarters, direct telephone line, email, and operating hours.</li>
    <li><strong>Branded Social Links:</strong> Styled pills with custom SVG icons for Instagram, Facebook, X (Twitter), and YouTube.</li>
    <li><strong>Inquiry Form:</strong> Form handling with validation and animated <code>CheckCircle2</code> confirmation banner.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.11 Real-Time Ticker (<code>Ticker.jsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Clock Heartbeat:</strong> Second-by-second live digital clock.</li>
    <li><strong>Live Geolocation:</strong> Integrates with OpenStreetMap Nominatim reverse geocoding API to dynamically display the visitor's current city and country code.</li>
    <li><strong>Infinite Hardware-Accelerated Marquee:</strong> Dual-array seamless continuous CSS scroll.</li>
</ul>

